{
  "Content": "<div class=\"chapter\" title=\"Recommendations organised by site of cancer\" id=\"ng12-recommendations-organised-by-site-of-cancer\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\">\r\n  <h2 class=\"title\" id=\"recommendations-organised-by-site-of-cancer\">Recommendations organised by site of cancer</h2>\r\n  <div class=\"panel panel--primary\">\r\n    <p>Use this guideline to guide referrals. If still uncertain about whether a referral is needed, consider contacting a specialist (see the <a class=\"link\" href=\"recommendations-on-patient-support-safety-netting-and-the-diagnostic-process#the-diagnostic-process\" target=\"_top\" rel=\"internal\" data-chapter=\"recommendations-on-patient-support-safety-netting-and-the-diagnostic-process\" data-original-url=\"#the-diagnostic-process\">recommendations on the diagnostic process</a>). Consider a review for people with any symptom associated with increased cancer risk who do not meet the criteria for referral or investigative action (see the <a class=\"link\" href=\"recommendations-on-patient-support-safety-netting-and-the-diagnostic-process#safety-netting\" target=\"_top\" rel=\"internal\" data-chapter=\"recommendations-on-patient-support-safety-netting-and-the-diagnostic-process\" data-original-url=\"#safety-netting\">recommendations on safety netting</a>).</p>\r\n  </div>\r\n</div>",
